\begin{defi} \label{definition axioms of dr}
    % Let $X$ be a set, and $d_r\colon X\times X\to \mathbb{R}_{\geq 0}\cup\{\infty\}$ be maps indexed by $r>0$. 
    Let $X$ be a set, and $\{d_r \colon X \times X \to \mathbb{R}_{\geq 0}\cup\{\infty\} \}_{r>0}$ be a family of functions indexed by $r>0$. 
    % In this paper, we consider the following axioms for the pair $(X, \{d_r\}_{r>0})$: 
    % Let $x, y, z\in X$ be three elements. Then
