{Representative density reconstructions from the trained R2D-Net are shown in \autoref{fig:median_r2d_test_recon}. Unlike the R2P-VAE, the R2D-Net only provides a single estimate of the density fields for every test case. We find that, like the R2P-VAE, the R2D-Net provides highly accurate density reconstructions that are very close to the ground truth.}

