\title{Quantum SAT Problems with Finite Sets of Projectors are Complete for a Plethora of Classes}


\author{Ricardo Rivera Cardoso$^{1,}$\thanks{ricardo.rivera@savba.sk} \,, Alex Meiburg$^{2,3, }$\thanks{bqp@ohaithe.re} \,, and Daniel Nagaj$^{1, }$\thanks{daniel.nagaj@savba.sk} \ \\
