is a bit similar to the one
presented in Fig.~\ref{V_iso_light.pdf}, where the anti-localization co-exists
with the impurity-induced localized oscillation. The clear difference is an expected asymmetry of 
the wave patterns in Fig.~\ref{V_linear.pdf}. In  Fig.~\ref{V_linear.pdf}a we
also observe weakening of the propagating component near the defect but not
zeroing. Increasing the coefficient $B_R$ one can see that the amplitude of
