		Recall that the $K$-algebra $\LX $ is generated by the characteristic functions $1_{U},$ where $U$ are compact open subsets of $X.$
	 It follows   that  $\LX \otimes _K  \LX$ is a commutative $K$-algebra generated by idempotents. 
