 Using the  $K$-algebra isomorphism $\Psi $ from \eqref{eq:IsoPsi}, we  transform the   $ A_K(\sG)$-bimodule $M$ into a $\LX \rtimes _{\hat{\0}} {\mathcal S}^{a}(\sG ) $-bimodule. Then  by Corollary~\ref{cor:flatHHH} there is a 
