    $E$ is a ribbon functor.
\end{lemma}

\begin{proof}
We need to check that the twist satisfies $$\theta^{\B_\A}_{E(X,\eta^X)}=E\left(\theta^{\hat{\B}^G}_{(X,\eta^X)}\right).$$ 
The left hand side was already computed above. Using the expression for ribbon twist in the equivariantised category from Section~\ref{sec:crossed_equiv}, we see that the right hand side is
