\subsection{IQA evaluation}
To give a baseline assessment of the validity of common IQA measures, we compare their values to the manual ratings. The chosen IQA measures were computed with default implementations provided by their authors, either in MATLAB or Python. For the evaluation of the IQ measures' performance, we employ the Spearman Rank Correlation Coefficient (SRCC) and the Kendall Rank Correlation Coefficient (KRCC), which assess the rank between the IQA measures and the manual ratings. 
